question:
트랜잭션 T1, T2, T3에 대하여 스케줄 s1, s2 중에서 충돌 직렬 가능한(conflict serializable) 것은?

[트랜잭션]
T1: r1(x); r1(z); w1(x);
T2: r2(z); r2(y); w2(z);
T3: r3(x); r3(y); w3(y);

[스케줄 s1]
r1(x); r2(z); r1(z); r3(x); r3(y);
w1(x); w3(y); r2(y); w2(z);

[스케줄 s2]
r1(x); r2(z); r3(x); r1(z); r2(y);
r3(y); w1(x); w2(z); w3(y);
